; blank glyph (slot 36) instead of garbage. Char cap raised to 13
; (80-col terminal). Slot map: A-Z -> char-0x41; 0-9 -> char-0x16;
; else -> 36. Backspace (0x08/0x7F) supported. Ink '*'.
